hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1802","[AI-translation] Imepokewa kutoka kwa Ibn 'Abbas (Radhiya Allaahu 'anhumaa) alisema: Abu Jahl alisema: Lau ningelimuona Muhammad anaswali kwenye Al-Kaaba, ningelikanyaga shingo yake. Basi ikamfikia Nabii (Swalla Allaahu 'alayhi wa sallam); akasema: Lau angefanya hivyo, malaika wangemchukua. (Bukhari: 4958)"
